[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]刘备两名女儿被曹军掳获[/color]（正史有载，见于《二主妃子传》注释，与长坂之战相关）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
